    thinking: "**Integrating Navigation Now**\n\nI\'m currently working to seamlessly integrate the navigation directly within the header\'s `.bg-white` container. My plan includes a comprehensive emoji replacement strategy, transitioning to SVG formats for improved visual consistency and scalability. The icons are currently being refined, I\'m considering a Grid/Collection SVG for \"All Plants,\" a Flower/Leaf SVG for \"Garden,\" and a Food icon for \"Food.\"\n\n\n**Refining Icon Choices**\n\nI\'ve decided to abandon emojis and have transitioned to using Lucide icons in SVG format, which are visually cleaner and more scalable. I\'ve chosen a grid icon for \"All Plants\", a leaf icon for \"Garden\", and an apple icon for \"Food\" to represent the different sections.\n\n\n"
