  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the requested improvements:\n\n*   **Header Consolidation**: The site title and description, as well as the category filter buttons, have all been cleanly integrated inside the main top white header container for a more structured, modern look.\n*   **Simple Icons**: The text-based emojis on the filter buttons have been replaced with clean, monochrome SVG icons that match the modern design language of the site.\n*   **Flip Button Fix**: The \"\343\201\223\343\201\237\343\201\210\343\202\222\343\201\277\343\202\213\" (See the answer) button was not working because the 3D rotation CSS rule was accidentally removed in the previous Tailwind update. I have restored the proper `rotateY(180deg)` rule, and both the buttons and the card clicks now smoothly flip the cards again!\n\nThe app is now fully functional and the UI is much cleaner. Feel free to interact with the preview!"
    modified_response: "I have implemented the requested improvements:\n\n*   **Header Consolidation**: The site title and description, as well as the category filter buttons, have all been cleanly integrated inside the main top white header container for a more structured, modern look.\n*   **Simple Icons**: The text-based emojis on the filter buttons have been replaced with clean, monochrome SVG icons that match the modern design language of the site.\n*   **Flip Button Fix**: The \"\343\201\223\343\201\237\343\201\210\343\202\222\343\201\277\343\202\213\" (See the answer) button was not working because the 3D rotation CSS rule was accidentally removed in the previous Tailwind update. I have restored the proper `rotateY(180deg)` rule, and both the buttons and the card clicks now smoothly flip the cards again!\n\nThe app is now fully functional and the UI is much cleaner. Feel free to interact with the preview!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
